# Property System — environment contract
# Copy to .dev.vars for local wrangler development. NEVER commit real secrets.
# Production values are configured as Cloudflare encrypted secrets — see
# CLOUDFLARE_DEPLOYMENT.md (PS-MASTER-001 §6, §29, §31, §32).

# --- Authentication (required) -------------------------------------------
# JWT signing secret (HS256). Use a long random string in production.
JWT_SECRET=change-me-to-a-long-random-secret

# Access token lifetime in seconds (default 43200 = 12h)
JWT_TTL_SECONDS=43200

# --- Admin bootstrap (required on first deployment) ----------------------
# Bootstrap INPUTS only (§3). Used exactly once, when no ADMIN account exists.
# They are never returned by an API, never rendered in the UI, never logged.
# A redeploy never recreates the Admin nor overwrites its password (§4).
# ADMIN_PASSWORD must be at least 12 characters (§5).
# After first login, rotate it from Settings → Security → Change Password (§14).
ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@example.com
ADMIN_PASSWORD=change-me-min-12-characters
